
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
  <title>48일 성경 암송 챌린지 (9/28 ~ 11/14)</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          colors: {
            brand: {
              50: '#f6f7f9',
              100: '#edeef3',
              200: '#d7dae4',
              500: '#435368',
              600: '#354354',
              700: '#283340',
              800: '#1d2631',
              900: '#141a22',
            },
            amberWarm: {
              50: '#fffbeb',
              100: '#fef3c7',
              500: '#f59e0b',
              600: '#d97706',
              800: '#92400e',
            }
          },
          fontFamily: {
            sans: ['Pretendard', '-apple-system', 'BlinkMacSystemFont', 'system-ui', 'Roboto', 'sans-serif'],
            serif: ['Nanum Myeongjo', 'Batang', 'serif'],
          }
        }
      }
    }
  </script>
  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nanum+Myeongjo:wght@400;700;800&family=Pretendard:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap');
    
    .font-bible {
      font-family: 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif;
      line-height: 1.85;
      letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    }
    
    .hide-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar {
      display: none;
    }
    .hide-scrollbar {
      -ms-overflow-style: none;
      scrollbar-width: none;
    }

    .card-shadow {
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px -5px rgba(26, 38, 57, 0.08), 0 4px 6px -2px rgba(26, 38, 57, 0.04);
    }

    @keyframes pulseGlow {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 0.8; transform: scale(1); }
      50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.02); }
    }
    .pulse-glow {
      animation: pulseGlow 2.5s infinite ease-in-out;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 min-h-screen flex flex-col font-sans selection:bg-amber-100 selection:text-amber-900">

  <!-- Entrance Screen (시작 입장 화면) -->
  <div id="entranceScreen" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 via-slate-800 to-amber-950/80 flex items-center justify-center p-4 backdrop-blur-md transition-all duration-500">
    <div class="max-w-md w-full bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-lg rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-2xl border border-white/20 text-center relative overflow-hidden animate-fadeIn">
      <div class="absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-32 h-32 bg-amber-200/50 rounded-full blur-2xl"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-12 -left-12 w-32 h-32 bg-indigo-200/50 rounded-full blur-2xl"></div>

      <!-- Icon & Subtitle -->
      <div class="relative z-10">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-amber-500 to-amber-400 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mx-auto shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/30 mb-4">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-book-bible"></i>
        </div>

        <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-50 text-amber-800 text-xs font-bold mb-2">
          2026. 09. 28 ~ 11. 14 (48일 여정)
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-800 tracking-tight mb-1">말씀 암송 48일 챌린지</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          매일 하루 한 구절씩 마음에 새겨 영혼을 채웁니다.<br>암송을 함께할 이름을 입력해주세요.
        </p>

        <!-- Name Input Form -->
        <div class="space-y-3 mb-5">
          <div class="text-left">
            <label for="entranceNameInput" class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-600 block mb-1.5 flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-user-pen text-amber-500"></i> 암송자 이름 (또는 닉네임)
            </label>
            <input 
              type="text" 
              id="entranceNameInput" 
              maxlength="12" 
              placeholder="예: 요한, 마리아, 말씀사랑"
              class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl border border-slate-300 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-500 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800 bg-slate-50/50 focus:bg-white transition text-center shadow-inner"
            />
          </div>
          <p id="entranceErrorMsg" class="text-[11px] text-rose-500 font-medium hidden">이름을 한 글자 이상 입력해주세요!</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Action Button -->
        <button 
          id="enterChallengeBtn"
          class="w-full py-3.5 px-6 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-amber-600 hover:from-amber-600 hover:to-amber-700 text-white font-bold text-sm shadow-md shadow-amber-500/25 transition active:scale-95 flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
          <span>오늘의 말씀으로 입장하기</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
        </button>

        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-4">
          * 입력한 이름으로 내 암송 현황과 달성률이 기록됩니다.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <header class="bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md sticky top-0 z-40 border-b border-slate-200">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-3 flex items-center justify-between">
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-2.5">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-book-bible"></i>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800 leading-tight">말씀 암송 48일</h1>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-medium">9월 28일 ~ 11월 14일</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <button id="profileEditBtn" class="px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200 text-xs font-semibold transition flex items-center gap-1 active:scale-95" title="내 이름 변경">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-user-pen text-slate-500"></i>
          <span id="headerUserName">이름 설정</span>
        </button>
        <button id="todayJumpBtn" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-amber-600 transition flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-sm active:scale-95">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-day"></i>
          <span>오늘 구절</span>
        </button>
        <button id="openCommunityBtn" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 hover:bg-indigo-100 text-xs font-semibold transition flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-sm active:scale-95" title="공동체 암송 현황">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-users"></i>
          <span class="hidden sm:inline">우리 공동체</span>
        </button>
        <button id="toggleListBtn" class="p-2 rounded-lg text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-100 transition active:scale-95" title="전체 목록">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-list-ul text-base"></i>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto w-full px-4 pt-4 pb-20 flex-1 flex flex-col">
    <!-- Progress Indicator Bar with Community Overview -->
    <div class="bg-white p-3.5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 mb-4 shadow-sm space-y-3">
      <!-- My Progress -->
      <div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xs font-medium text-slate-600 mb-1.5">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 inline-block animate-ping"></span>
            <span class="font-bold text-slate-800"><span id="userNicknameBadge">말씀동행자</span>님의 암송 달성률</span>
          </span>
          <span id="progressText" class="font-bold text-slate-800">0 / 48일 (0%)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full h-2.5 bg-slate-100 rounded-full overflow-hidden p-0.5">
          <div id="progressBar" class="h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-emerald-500 rounded-full transition-all duration-500" style="width: 0%"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Community Overall Progress Summary -->
      <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-500">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-users-viewfinder text-indigo-500"></i>
          <span>공동체 전체 평균 달성률: <strong id="commAvgText" class="text-indigo-600">0%</strong> (<span id="commMemberCount">0</span>명 참여 중)</span>
        </div>
        <button id="quickViewCommBtn" class="text-indigo-600 font-bold hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
          멤버별 진도 보기 <i class="fa-solid fa-angle-right text-[10px]"></i>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Today Badge & Date Navigation Bar -->
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3 px-1">
      <button id="prevDayBtn" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white text-slate-600 text-xs font-medium hover:bg-slate-50 active:scale-95 flex items-center gap-1 transition">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-left"></i> 이전
      </button>

      <div class="text-center">
        <div id="badgeToday" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 mb-0.5">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-sparkles"></i> 오늘의 암송구절
        </div>
        <div id="currentDateDisplay" class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600">2026. 09. 28 (월) · Day 1</div>
      </div>

      <button id="nextDayBtn" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white text-slate-600 text-xs font-medium hover:bg-slate-50 active:scale-95 flex items-center gap-1 transition">
        다음 <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i>
      </button>
    </div>

    <!-- The Scripture Card -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/90 card-shadow overflow-hidden flex flex-col transition-all duration-300">
      <!-- Card Top Info -->
      <div class="p-5 pb-3 border-b border-slate-100 flex items-start justify-between">
        <div>
          <span id="verseThemeBadge" class="text-[11px] font-bold text-amber-700 bg-amber-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg inline-block mb-1.5">
            이사야 43장 구원의 약속
          </span>
          <h2 id="verseReference" class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
            이사야 43:1절
          </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-slate-400">
          <button id="speakBtn" class="p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-slate-700 transition" title="말씀 낭독 듣기">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-volume-high text-lg"></i>
          </button>
          <button id="copyBtn" class="p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-slate-700 transition" title="구절 복사">
            <i class="fa-regular fa-copy text-lg"></i>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Mode Selector Tabs -->
      <div class="px-5 pt-3 flex gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold border-b border-slate-100/70 pb-2.5 overflow-x-auto hide-scrollbar">
        <button data-mode="full" class="mode-tab px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-white transition active:scale-95">
          전체 보기
        </button>
        <button data-mode="typing" class="mode-tab px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 hover:bg-indigo-100 transition active:scale-95 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-keyboard"></i> 타자 암송
        </button>
        <button data-mode="initial" class="mode-tab px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-200 transition active:scale-95">
          초성 힌트
        </button>
        <button data-mode="blank" class="mode-tab px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-200 transition active:scale-95">
          빈칸 모드
        </button>
        <button data-mode="blind" class="mode-tab px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-200 transition active:scale-95">
          가리기 암송
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Verse Content Box -->
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center min-h-[260px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-amber-50/20">
        <div id="verseContent" class="font-bible text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-800 leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line text-left transition-all duration-200 select-text">
          <!-- Text inserted via JS -->
        </div>

        <!-- Typing Practice Container (Visible only in 'typing' mode) -->
        <div id="typingContainer" class="hidden mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 flex flex-col gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
            <span class="font-semibold text-slate-600 flex items-center gap-1">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-pen-nib text-amber-500"></i> 타자로 말씀을 입력하며 암송해보세요:
            </span>
            <span id="typingAccuracy" class="font-bold text-indigo-600 bg-indigo-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md">
              정확도 0%
            </span>
          </div>

          <!-- Real-time Comparison Preview -->
          <div id="typingFeedback" class="text-sm p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 font-bible text-slate-400 min-h-[50px] leading-relaxed break-keep select-none">
            여기에 입력 중인 말씀이 실시간으로 대조됩니다...
          </div>

          <textarea id="typingInput" rows="3" placeholder="위 구절을 보고 타이핑하거나 외워서 적어보세요..." 
            class="w-full p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 text-sm leading-relaxed resize-none bg-white font-bible shadow-inner"></textarea>
          
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-400">
            <button id="resetTypingBtn" class="hover:text-slate-600 text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-1">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-left"></i> 처음부터 다시 쓰기
            </button>
            <span id="typingMatchMessage" class="font-medium text-emerald-600 hidden">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-check-double"></i> 말씀과 완벽히 일치합니다!
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p id="modeHelper" class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-4 text-center italic hidden">
          * 빈칸 박스를 터치하면 숨겨진 단어가 나타납니다.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Bottom Actions: Memorized Checkbox -->
      <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 bg-slate-50/90 border-t border-slate-100 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-500">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-clock-rotate-left"></i>
          <span id="dateRangeInfo">2026.09.28 암송 구절</span>
        </div>
        <button id="toggleCompleteBtn" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-5 py-2.5 rounded-2xl font-bold text-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-all shadow-sm active:scale-95 bg-white border border-slate-300 text-slate-700 hover:border-emerald-500 hover:text-emerald-700">
          <i class="fa-regular fa-circle-check text-lg"></i>
          <span id="toggleCompleteBtnText">오늘 암송 완료하기</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Navigation Pills (Days 1 to 48) Drawer/Modal Trigger -->
    <div class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-between">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-700">48일 여정 목록</h3>
      <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">총 48일 (구절 52개 압축)</span>
    </div>

    <div id="allDaysContainer" class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-4 sm:grid-cols-6 gap-2">
      <!-- Generated via JS -->
    </div>
  </main>

  <!-- Community Leaderboard / Member Progress Modal -->
  <div id="communityModal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center p-4 hidden">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl max-w-lg w-full max-h-[85vh] flex flex-col shadow-2xl border border-slate-100 overflow-hidden">
      <!-- Modal Header -->
      <div class="p-5 border-b border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between bg-slate-50/70">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-users"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800">우리 공동체 암송 현황</h3>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">함께 48일 말씀 완주를 향해 달려갑니다</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <button id="closeCommunityModal" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200/60 flex items-center justify-center transition">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-base"></i>
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Nickname Edit Strip -->
      <div class="px-5 py-3 bg-amber-50/50 border-b border-amber-100/60 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-slate-500 font-medium">내 닉네임:</span>
          <span id="currentNicknameText" class="font-bold text-slate-800">말씀동행자</span>
        </div>
        <button id="changeNicknameBtn" class="text-amber-700 font-semibold hover:underline flex items-center gap-1">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-pen text-[10px]"></i> 닉네임 변경
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Community Overall Stats Box -->
      <div class="p-5 border-b border-slate-100 grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-center">
        <div class="bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/70">
          <span class="block text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-medium mb-0.5">참여 인원</span>
          <span id="modalMemberCount" class="text-lg font-black text-slate-800">0명</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-indigo-50/60 p-3 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-100">
          <span class="block text-[11px] text-indigo-700 font-medium mb-0.5">전체 평균 달성률</span>
          <span id="modalCommAvg" class="text-lg font-black text-indigo-600">0%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-emerald-50/60 p-3 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-100">
          <span class="block text-[11px] text-emerald-700 font-medium mb-0.5">총 암송 완료 수</span>
          <span id="modalTotalCompleted" class="text-lg font-black text-emerald-600">0절</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Member Progress List -->
      <div class="p-5 flex-1 overflow-y-auto space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">멤버별 암송 진도표</h4>
        <div id="communityMembersList" class="space-y-2.5">
          <div class="text-center py-8 text-xs text-slate-400">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-spinner fa-spin text-lg mb-2"></i>
            <p>공동체 멤버 정보를 불러오는 중입니다...</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Modal Footer -->
      <div class="p-4 border-t border-slate-100 bg-slate-50 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-500">
        <span>클라우드 동기화로 실시간 업데이트됩니다.</span>
        <button id="closeCommunityModalBottom" class="px-4 py-2 bg-slate-800 text-white rounded-xl font-bold hover:bg-slate-900 transition">
          확인
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Nickname Prompt Custom Dialog (Never use prompt/alert) -->
  <div id="nicknameModal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm flex items-center justify-center p-4 hidden">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl max-w-xs w-full p-5 shadow-2xl border border-slate-100 text-center">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-600 flex items-center justify-center text-xl mx-auto mb-3">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-user-tag"></i>
      </div>
      <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-base mb-1">공동체 닉네임 설정</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-4">함께하는 분들이 알아볼 수 있는 이름을 입력해주세요.</p>
      <input type="text" id="nicknameInput" maxlength="12" placeholder="예: 요한, 마리아, 말씀사랑"
        class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 border border-slate-300 rounded-xl text-sm mb-4 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-amber-500 text-center font-medium">
      <div class="flex gap-2">
        <button id="cancelNicknameBtn" class="flex-1 py-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 text-slate-600 text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-slate-50">
          취소
        </button>
        <button id="saveNicknameBtn" class="flex-1 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-bold hover:bg-amber-600 shadow-sm">
          저장하기
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

